title Login flow
direction down

Start [shape: oval, color: green]
Enter credentials [icon: user]
Account exists? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Password valid? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
MFA enabled? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Send code [icon: mail]
Code valid? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Too many attempts? [shape: diamond, color: orange]
Lock account [icon: lock, color: red]
Show error [icon: alert, color: red]
Create session [icon: key, color: blue]
Redirect to app [icon: browser]
Offer sign up [icon: users]
