Start > Enter credentials > Account exists?
Account exists? > Password valid?: yes
Account exists? > Offer sign up: no
Password valid? > MFA enabled?: yes
Password valid? > Too many attempts?: no
Too many attempts? > Lock account: yes
Too many attempts? > Show error: no
Show error > Enter credentials: retry
MFA enabled? > Send code: yes
MFA enabled? > Create session: no
Send code > Code valid?
Code valid? > Create session: yes
Code valid? > Show error: no
Create session > Redirect to app > End
Lock account, Offer sign up > End
